    {
      "id": "claim_fd0341e4c3414674b725e6cace8b08c0",
      "statement": "The engine emits exactly five trace event shapes — derive, reject, deadend, join, unknown — carrying the fields (fact ids, rule name, reason, kind, evidence) that production code needs, appended to one verbose store that is never trimmed at search time; the three render views (success-path, failure-trail, full) are projections over that same store built by build_views when the VerificationResult is constructed [v1].",
