    {
      "id": "claim_3949bd85bc414ec3ae38cdf2ff332ffa",
      "statement": "The physics driver routes every word problem through deduction, never induction: verify_physics extracts givens and a target kind, constructs Engine(get_physics_rules()), builds a target Fact, and calls engine.deduce(givens, target); when no target kind is identifiable it short-circuits to an UNKNOWN result carrying the evidence note 'phrase your target as find the <quantity>'; induction remains the forward-mode API for other drivers and the data-plentiful case [v1].",
