      "statement": "The engine is the domain-agnostic core: a new domain plugs in by supplying a list of Transformations whose precondition returns None or a reason string and whose relation produces the output fact via a solver hook token; the engine calls precond then apply and never imports sympy directly — the grammar's relation closure performs the solver dispatch through the SOLVERS registry.",
